 "name_en": "Warehouse Outbound Processing to Customer with Batch Management (1V7)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Warehouse Outbound Processing to Customer with Batch Management (1V7)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiof1e656f527be4065ab20d289827b5a5f\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof1e656f527be4065ab20d289827b5a5f__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item describes the usage of batch-managed products in a warehouse outbound process. You manage stock on a storage bin level using basic warehouse management functionality in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span>. The process starts with the creation of a sales order. During sales order creation, you enter customer-specific requirements for the selection of batches. The customer-specific batch selection criteria are then considered by the system when it determines the stock to be picked. The system makes sure that only those batches that meet the customer's requirements are considered. You can continue with the basic warehouse outbound or extended warehouse outbound process to complete picking, packing, staging, and loading.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof1e656f527be4065ab20d289827b5a5f__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create sales order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create delivery</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Check simulated batch determination (optional)</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof1e656f527be4065ab20d289827b5a5f__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage stock on a storage bin level</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Demonstrate the capability of using batch-managed products, customer-specific batch determination criteria and the actual batch selection in the warehouse outbound process</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Enable warehouse processes with RF/mobile</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>使用批次管理的客户仓库出库处理 (1V7)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiof1e656f527be4065ab20d289827b5a5f\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof1e656f527be4065ab20d289827b5a5f__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目描述仓库出库流程中批次管理产品的使用。使用 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 中的基本仓库管理功能在仓位级别管理库存。该流程从创建销售订单开始。在销售订单创建期间，为批次选择输入客户特定的需求。然后，系统在确定要拣配的库存时会考虑客户特定的批次选择条件。系统确保仅考虑满足客户需求的批次。您可以继续基本仓库出库或扩展仓库出库流程，以完成拣配、包装、备料和装货。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof1e656f527be4065ab20d289827b5a5f__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建销售订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建交货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">检查模拟批次确定（可选）</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof1e656f527be4065ab20d289827b5a5f__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在仓位级别管理库存</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">演示在仓库出库流程中使用批次管理产品、客户特定批次确定条件和实际批次选择的功能</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过 RF/移动设备启用仓库流程</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
